ou mark the lugano ferry task as done, please?\", \"Could you find the craly water for me, please?\", \"Would you mind moving the arts task to next monday and the knysna community to monday, please?\", \"Could you tell me who's coming to it?\", \"One more thing — could you please star the booking voucher document?\"], [\"I had a few thoughts while practising earlier and don't want to lose them, so can you make a note: ideas for the tambourine.\", \"Oh and I finally got that one sorted this morning, so you can tick off the lugano ferry task as done.\", \"Different thing, I need to check something and can't remember where I put it — can you find the craly water for me?\", \"My week's got a bit messy, so could you shift the arts task to next monday and move the knysna community to monday?\", \"And just so I know what to expect when I get there, who's coming to it?\", \"Oh, before I forget, I'll want it handy later, so can you star the booking voucher document?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0029\", \"v\": [[\"latest journal entry\", \"astrophotography lesson — what day?\", \"make up a PIN for my new card\"], [\"whats my most recent journal entry\", \"what day's the astrophotography lesson on\", \"can u come up with a pin for my new card\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0030\", \"v\": [[\"i messaged Fosbaen today, can u log it\", \"the Halvorsen one\"], [\"I finally got round to replying to a few people earlier — I messaged Fosbaen today, could you log that for me?\", \"Sorry, should've been clearer there — it was Fosbaen Halvorsen.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0031\", \"v\": [[\"pls log it: Fosbaen upstairs, messaged today\"], [\"Fosbaen upstairs — messaged today, log it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0032\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you move the knysna community, like, an hour earlier?\"], [\"knysna community an hour earlier\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0033\", \"v\": [[\"which steps of the chase job r still open\"], [\"open chase steps?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0034\", \"v\": [[\"so when's the, um, when do I have the sale?\